_rovaniemi_lampela","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["mcdonaldsrovaniemilampela","rovaniemi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"For over two decades the world's northernmost McD was at Rovaniemi, and perhaps again, as the ones in Arkhangelsk and Murmansk (Russia) are no more McD. In 2024 Rovaniemi McD moved some 1 km southwards and is now located next to Minimani hypermarket a bit outside downtown.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Rovaniemi"},{"id":"rovaniemi_wv_roy_club","areaId":"rovaniemi","name":"Roy Club","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":66.50166,"lng":25.73047},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"rovaniemi_wv_roy_club","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://royclub.fi","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["royclub","rovaniemi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"00:00","close":"04:30"},{"open":"00:00","close":"04:30"},{"open":"23:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"23:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"23:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"23:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"00:00","close":"04:30"}]},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Known as Roippari by the locals. Small nightclub established in 1985 and open every single day of the year. Awarded as the Best Bar in Finland 2016. Karaoke pub in the ground floor, nightclub in the cellar. Age limit 18.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Rovaniemi"},{"id":"rovaniemi_wv_pub_pisto","areaId":"rovaniemi","name":"Pub Pisto","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":66.50149,"lng":25.73273},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"rovaniemi_wv_pub_pisto","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["pubpisto","rovaniemi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"09:00","close":"23:59"},null],"note":"Closed Sun"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"A stylish public house established already in 1960. According to famous Rovaniemi-born novellist Jari Tervo \"You haven't been in Rovaniemi unless you have been in Pisto\". This pub appears in many of Tervo's novels.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Rovaniemi"},{"id":"rovaniemi_wv_cafe_kauppayhtio","areaId":"rovaniemi","name":"Café Kauppayhtiö","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":66.50286,"lng":25.73484},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"rovaniemi_wv_cafe_kauppayhtio","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.kauppayhtio.fi/en","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cafekauppayhtio","rovaniemi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Sandwich shop, ice cream, milkshakes, hamburger restaurant and bar. Lunch. Its slogan is \"the café where everything is for sale\". The Pure Pizza has authentic Neapolitan style pizzas.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Rovaniemi"},{"id":"rovaniemi_wv_restaurant_himo","areaId":"rovaniemi","name":"Restaurant Himo","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":66.50175,"lng":25.73385},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"rovaniemi_wv_restaurant_himo","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.ravintolahimo.fi/en/himo.html","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["restauranthimo","rovaniemi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"14:00","close":"22:00"},null],"note":"Closed Sun"},"summary":"Asian restaurant specialising in Japanese food. Run and maintained by a Vietnamese-origin chef. Also offers a cooking program (ideal for those staying in the country for a long time).","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Rovaniemi"},{"id":"rovaniemi_wv_cafe_toivo","areaId":"rovaniemi","name":"Café Toivo","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":66.4992,"lng":25.72641},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"rovaniemi_wv_cafe_toivo","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://cafetoivo.fi","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cafetoivo","rovaniemi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Excellent baked goods and lunch. Very fresh ingredients and all made on site including baked goods. The café itself is closed for the time being, but catering is available.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Rovaniemi"},{"id":"rovaniemi_wv_kansan_pubi","areaId":"rovaniemi","name":"Kansan Pubi","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":66.50162,"lng":25.72589},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"rovaniemi_wv_kansan_pubi","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["kansanpubi","rovaniemi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"16:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"16:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"16:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"16:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"16:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"16:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"16:00","close":"23:59"}]},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Cheapest and therefore also fairly popular among young locals. Might be surprisingly crowded during the weekend evenings before people head to the nightclubs. Age limit 18.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"